   "page": 58,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• If blood/mucous in the stool, refer. • Send stool for ova, cysts and parasites. Indicate on request form if patient has HIV. • Test for HIV 124 and manage according to result:",
   "bbox": [
    477.3,
    262.6,
    780.7,
    292.8
